0result.sql has the correct filter window, uses CURRENT_DATE for a live age calculation, formats start_date into a readable string (no micro‑second epoch left over) and matches every column the prompt asks for.  
1result.sql is similar but keeps the timezone suffix that isn’t required, and 2result.sql hard‑codes the year 2024 and leaves start_date in raw micro‑seconds, so both fall short of the specification.  

```plaintext
0result.sql
